Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Flowers That Bloom for Me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 37
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it’s terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All our withered leaves have been taken away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought they’d manage to snatch them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do those Flower Bugs always steal your withered leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, those Flower Bugs used to live on the surface of the mud
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all doing our own work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the Flower Bugs suddenly grew in size
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and their numbers skyrocketed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They spent all day just eating
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and stopped digging or loosening the soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There weren’t enough withered leaves outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so the Flower Bugs started stealing our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From then on, we hid our remaining withered leaves in the burrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to keep them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But to our surprise, they still got stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.33,0:01:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, did you notice anything odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re welcoming us so warmly, even though their food is almost all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The sudden increase in the size and number of Flower Bugs…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,it might be related to the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.85,0:01:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Our food supply has been taken away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There should still be withered leaves in the Withered Leaf Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go fetch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That zone has been overrun by Flower Bugs lately, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let Your Majesty take that risk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But you’re injured right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t beat those Flower Bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have a way to retrieve the withered leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.41,0:01:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t we go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You are our guests, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no need to put yourselves in danger for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we came down to look for a certain multicolored fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect the changes in the Flower Bugs are linked to that fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We might as well go and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But those Flower Bugs are formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid you might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re underestimating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only will I not get hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but I’m also capable of protecting you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to that Flower Tribe member who just makes a lot of noise,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I find these two guests much more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that Flower Tribe member seems to have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.83,0:02:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why didn’t you say so sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have been carried off by the bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and look around for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.75,0:02:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the place where Flower Babies look for the Spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Xi Huahua, it looks like you’ve never been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this place like the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We’d better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you’re the most talented flower on the Xilan Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,People are just being too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I’m here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll have to settle for second place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because {\i1}I’m{\i0} the one who’s truly the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don’t we have a contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s see whose Flower Baby grasps the Spark first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just with your Flower Baby who does nothing but eat…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, am a Flower Baby with the best potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei Huahua
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.12,0:03:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You really are a good Flower Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei Huahua
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.27,0:04:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuangzhuang, you aren’t allowed to eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lower your Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems our Flower Babies love to eat just as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Xi Huahua is already competing with Mei Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This Flower Baby trial is going to be quite a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many Flower Bugs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The withered leaves are over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s sneak over and grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And keep an eye out for the fragment while we’re at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you using sign language again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant, check for the fragment while we’re at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, this flower is called a Rocket Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It symbolizes a vibrant life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go over there and see if there’s a Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This flower makes me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Do you feel a connection now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This flower makes me feel allergic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.01,0:05:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not going to be one of those clichés
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,where they wake up, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How did a flower suddenly appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just a flower; it’s fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s try this flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This flower won’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a Laughing Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It has the power to make people happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re laughing so happily;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean you have a Spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m laughing at myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I actually believed a Flower Baby like me could have a Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no use trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A Flower Baby like me can never become a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why give up so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you are a genius of the Flower Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you possibly understand an ordinary Flower Baby like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.90,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I loved playing with my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was the slowest runner,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and I fell down easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time, I could only watch their backs as they ran into the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To catch up with my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I practiced running every day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,falling down and getting back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, one day…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.18,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I became the fastest goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,used to be just as clumsy as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren’t clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that with hard work and persistence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone can be a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s give it another try, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of flower is called Bamboo Node.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It can extend and retract at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m really angry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to throw it—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go down and get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi Huahua, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge withered leaf actually fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s one here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know why, but we’re saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All these withered branches—what a lucky break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I’m out of energy right at a moment like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Xi Huahua, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Mei Huahua!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve obtained a Spark!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s amazing! Let’s go celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, jump over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too far; I can’t make the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.60,0:10:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a Bamboo Node!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, use the Bamboo Node in your hand to jump over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.23,0:10:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It has sprouted a flower bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If we just plant it back in the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it will bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo Node’s flower symbolizes a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But no Flower Baby has ever got a Spark from Bamboo Nodes before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo Node.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is happening up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Things keep falling down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.19,0:11:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what’s going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it saved our lives, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, did you find that fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were fighting the Flower Bugs earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,we didn’t find the fragment on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know of any other places with Flower Bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it has to be the Bug Nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bug Nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
